{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-elite-business-bay-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"elite-business-bay-residence","about":"Elite Business Bay, a prestigious development by one of Dubai's top real estate developers, introduces the luxurious Elite Business Bay Residence. This magnificent 24-story residential tower, strategically located in the vibrant Business Bay area, near the picturesque Dubai Water Canal, offers unrivaled views of the iconic Burj Khalifa, The Dubai Mall, the mesmerizing Dubai Fountain, and the spectacular Downtown Dubai skyline, making it one of Dubai's most sought-after addresses.The Elite Business Bay Residence is not just a place to live; it's a lifestyle choice for those seeking elegance and convenience in the heart of Dubai. Offering a range of fully furnished living spaces from cozy studios to spacious 1, 2, and 4-bedroom apartments, with sizes ranging from 410 sq. ft. to an expansive 2,200 sq. ft., Elite Business Bay caters to diverse preferences and lifestyles. Each home within the Elite Tower Business Bay has been meticulously crafted by a team of expert designers, ensuring that every detail contributes to the luxurious lifestyle envisioned by its residents.For a closer look at what life is like in this prestigious development, Elite Business Bay Residence photos showcase the sophistication and attention to detail that are hallmarks of the Elite Business Bay offerings. Potential residents interested in Elite Business Bay Residence rent options will find themselves spoilt for choice, with a variety of configurations and sizes available to suit every need.","price":640000,"title":"Elite Business Bay Residence","bitrix":{"id":362,"pf_id":"are.2.9242","source":null,"project_id":"Elite Business Bay Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Elite Business Bay Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Triplanet Group","pr